    "sentence_translations": [
      "(6) Will We See Each Other Again?",
      "",
      "Gao Ming and Leng Xiaoxi are talking.",
      "",
      "“I … I …” Leng Xiaoxi wants to tell Gao Ming that she isn’t studying at Xijing University anymore.",
      "",
      "“Gao Ming, Gao Ming! Let’s go, it’s time for class!” Someone is calling Gao Ming.",
      "",
      "This person is Gao Ming’s friend. Gao Ming looks at him and says, “OK, got it!”",
      "",
      "Gao Ming then looks at Leng Xiaoxi and says, “Sorry, I must go.”",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi says, “OK, really nice to meet you. See you!”",
      "",
      "Gao Ming says, “We … we will see each other again?”",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi smiles and says, “I hope we can see each other again!”",
      "",
      "Gao Ming also smiles. He is very happy and says, “The umbrella, I’m giving it to you!”",
      "",
      "Gao Ming and his friend leave together. Leng Xiaoxi looks at the umbrella and then looks at Gao Ming.",
      "Gao Ming is in the rain. He is also looking at Leng Xiaoxi. He is smiling. He is really happy …"
    ]
